{"availability":"available","full":"gitfeber/UAVGroundControlStation","name":"UAVGroundControlStation","description":"Ground control station using MAVLink telemetry from TX16S/ELRS","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-20T13:43:34Z","updated":"2026-07-22T21:10:45Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":"https://app.uavgroundcontrolstation.com/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:02.127Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:02.127Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:02.127Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:18:02.127Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A local ground control station for UAVs — map, telemetry, and serial link in one dashboard.","Website: uavgroundcontrolstation.com · Hosted Web App: app.uavgroundcontrolstation.com","UAV Ground Control Station is a slim, locally operated GCS that runs on the operator’s machine. A shared React UI shows position, battery, radio link, flight mode, and session stats on a MapLibre map — whether data arrives over CRSF, MAVLink, or both."],"features":["Live map with flight track (up to 5000 points), home reference, distance, heading-aligned drone chevron (falls back to a circle when heading is unknown), bottom-center Attitude HUD (pitch ladder, roll arc, heading tape,…","Telemetry sidebar — Text or Inst (mini gauges with the same telemetry fields as text mode); drag card headers (⠿) to reorder (shared order for both views, stored in uav-gcs.sidebar.order); Reset restores recommended…","Serial link — port picker (USB/PNP preferred), manual path entry, common baud rates","Activity log — connection status, parser stats, frame message stats; actionable link-issue banners for serial denial, busy ports, silence after connect, and parser spikes","Optional video stream (MJPEG, etc.) via environment variables; crosshair overlay; when the stream is live, a Ground Target pane